, to long point breaks, big outer deep water breaks, and fun performance waves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Players and Characters</strong></u> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not bound to one explorer. Choose from a variety of players. But know that each player affects the physics in the game. Change players and change the feel of the game, especially in the surfing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733280/extras/3640b72f35fc12d136182fc19bf353d1.avif?t=1770952876\" width=512 height=230 /></span><i>Live Your Life According to The Surfers Code!</i></p>","developers":["E Marx"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733280/cf026099927f24cab72bd3afaef2f31caa8e9b12/header.jpg?t=1770952876","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2733280/1685233001/90321b34dde8c03f7cd27174de446db837382980/1750895301/dash_av1.mpd?t=1748557538","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2733280/1685233001/90321b34dde8c03f7cd27174de446db837382980/1750895301/dash_h264.mpd?t=1748557538","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2733280/1685233001/90321b34dde8c03f7cd27174de446db837382980/1750895301/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1748557538","id":257111548,"name":"Greatest Surf Adventure Of All Time","thum